<title>USA: Hubco Q4 oper diluted shr $0.48 vs $0.34.</title>
<headline>Hubco Q4 oper diluted shr $0.48 vs $0.34.</headline>
<dateline>MAHWAH, N.J. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted0.48		     0.34</p>
<p> Oper Net	  11,119		   8,056</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  23,033		   24,003</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted1.69		     1.44</p>
<p> Oper Net	  39,266		   34,565</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  23,225		   24,116</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 operating figures exclude merger-related and restructuring charges of $5,319,000 after tax, related to the consummation of the Westport Bancorp acquisition and five branch consolidations in Connecticut. Q4 results also exclude a special provision for loan losses of $4.0 million.</p>
<p>Full year operating figures exclude merger-related and restructuring charges of $15,429,000 after tax.</p>
</text>
